<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Culture &amp; Lifestyle</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-cul</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:39:28Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-cul" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1441?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-cul" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Naked Trump statue goes on display in Strasbourg</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eeccf3f48f45e3f7f7cc8273fd4fe3d54ad2bf81a7b506f3e91d3a4b36c9b398</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T18:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/naked-trump-statue-goes-on-display-in-strasbourg/a-79568640--b613f03d8e20.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/naked-trump-statue-goes-on-display-in-strasbourg/a-79568640?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Titled "The Orange Plague," a gold-coated statue presents Donald Trump sitting on a smaller man's back. The Danish artist blamed Trump for getting in the way of efforts to address climate change.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Paramount and Warner Bros merge into one Hollywood giant</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:85e02bc3cbd460e6bf6962d7237cae3a4d081b5a41c8e182c083fe0b3e91d60f</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T14:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/paramount-and-warner-bros-merge-into-one-hollywood-giant/a-79565762--fd1d53153557.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/paramount-and-warner-bros-merge-into-one-hollywood-giant/a-79565762?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Paramount has completed an $81 billion purchase of Warner Bros. Discovery, as its owner Skydance creates a new entertainment behemoth. Billionaire David Ellison's hostile takeover bid defeated rival efforts from Netflix.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why music in Iran is more than just entertainment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a7212532eb1eca78aee2fd8c7eeafeca2ef1c51dec710fa975959e54118e68e</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:39:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-music-in-iran-is-more-than-just-entertainment/a-79583224--67cbee1305a2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-music-in-iran-is-more-than-just-entertainment/a-79583224?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Iranian authorities are trying to persuade prominent singers in exile to return home. While the state seeks to harness music as a political tool, music has also become a powerful expression of dissent and resistance.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>This island in Kiribati could be the key to solve the Amelia Earhart mystery</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:302e340a53d94906ece0e4757305f79e219e87f28a2dd4c80e0db0008d59088e</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T11:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-island-in-kiribati-could-be-the-key-to-solve-the-amelia-earhart-mystery/a-79517455--5be17a2d6029.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-island-in-kiribati-could-be-the-key-to-solve-the-amelia-earhart-mystery/a-79517455?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nearly 90 years after US aviator Amelia Earhart vanished over the Pacific, a new expedition to the remote island of Nikumaroro hopes a lagoon anomaly could finally reveal the fate of her missing aircraft.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Servers at Munich's iconic Oktoberfest call for more respect</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f645a4432a740ead1779825bcfe9e9e7ccf9fe97d3f70c6bd2cd866b2c03072b</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T13:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/servers-at-munich-s-iconic-oktoberfest-call-for-more-respect/a-79491207--cd91ce591124.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/servers-at-munich-s-iconic-oktoberfest-call-for-more-respect/a-79491207?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Oktoberfest is famous the world over for beer, brass band music and Bavarian traditions. But staff are also reporting incidents of racism and sexism, and are taking a stand against discrimination.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>South Park satirist pushes for accountability in Cornell gang-rape lawsuit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f03fb09cce6ece0f0f30073e622fbc71d7859456d828058c4a4dc33b688aaf27</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T14:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-park-satirist-pushes-for-accountability-in-cornell-gang-rape-lawsuit/a-79475382--e2bb4e991ce2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-park-satirist-pushes-for-accountability-in-cornell-gang-rape-lawsuit/a-79475382?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Writer Toby Morton is using a new website to amplify allegations in a high-profile sexual assault lawsuit involving seven Cornell students. The reopening of the case is causing an outcry on social media.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Nobel Literature Prize: How the winner is secretly chosen</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5e535f6ba926f8cc6f897f395c8c0cd2f63527b7455ee53447544fc3dce8ea8d</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T13:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nobel-literature-prize-how-the-winner-is-secretly-chosen/a-79564151--42983d639d88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nobel-literature-prize-how-the-winner-is-secretly-chosen/a-79564151?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Can Xue is considered one of this year's favorites; Margaret Atwood and Salman Rushdie are other strong contenders. But what goes on behind the scenes in the selection of the Nobel Prize in Literature?</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Campus Project 2026: Georgia takes center stage</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3e15c3335e47b8e426b2b04877a033d4df19722f687c164290b0f314cb1aa99f</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T09:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/campus-project-2026-georgia-takes-center-stage/a-79380639--efaea8063cd9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/campus-project-2026-georgia-takes-center-stage/a-79380639?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Beethovenfest exchange project brings German and Georgian musical traditions together. And the reasons go beyond music.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>DW shows solidarity with Georgians' commitment to democracy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c139cbac82408e24c5c6edbe65520f2c285d8bf4af02736e3c72af71fd2924c2</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T15:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dw-shows-solidarity-with-georgians-commitment-to-democracy/a-79432731--f6945c635292.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dw-shows-solidarity-with-georgians-commitment-to-democracy/a-79432731?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cultural and media professionals in Georgia remain under threat. A DW panel brings together insiders who share their hopes and fears.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Beethoven and Andy Warhol: Rebel icons on show in Bonn</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a7599c34a92443615c667a304762143efa5cc4bff318bb9bf65498cba565eab8</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T12:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944--59ad6d6535a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The new exhibition "Beethoven by Warhol" at the Beethoven House in Bonn presents the pop artist's late masterpiece: a picture of Ludwig van Beethoven. The exhibition shares the story of the work with the public.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Pay to ghost your boss: Japan's resignation business</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dcb0f83845acf5a3d77e57853164a016ee2d9cea82e0e0f74b778b296e40a471</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T10:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pay-to-ghost-your-boss-japan-s-resignation-business/a-79213584--1937a091cd92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pay-to-ghost-your-boss-japan-s-resignation-business/a-79213584?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Resignation agencies in Japan help employees leave their jobs seamlessly in just 15 minutes. Young people are especially eager to use their services.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Manchester City Premier League charges: What do they mean?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52e402e1d6b19cf44ea7c69a31f5b009ccd023dbd2f76d19293dc0983ee266c2</id><updated>2026-10-07T15:38:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T11:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/manchester-city-premier-league-charges-what-do-they-mean/a-79485638--5f423a99075f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/manchester-city-premier-league-charges-what-do-they-mean/a-79485638?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Since being bought by the UAE in 2008, Manchester City have become one of the world's most successful football clubs. A raft of serious financial charges threatens to undermine this and bring chaos to the Premier League.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
